Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.12,0:00:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:12.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}第28集 公厕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:20.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}又是一台兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:23.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a Lamborghini again!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 我需要对卡莱布 做一些说服工作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.24,0:00:30.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Clearly, Kaleb needed some convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:33.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我跟他说了几个数字
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:33.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I hit him with a couple of numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:36.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}7.8升
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:36.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}7.8 litres.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:37.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}马力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.76,0:00:37.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Horsepower?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}340匹 我去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.12,0:00:41.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}340 horsepower. Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}之前那台兰博基尼只有270匹
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:44.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Not 270 in the old Lamborghini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}340
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.24,0:00:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}340.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}前几天犁地让我明白了一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:49.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It was ploughing, the other day, taught me the lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}270匹马力不够用
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:53.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I was struggling with only 270 horsepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}接着我说出了最重要的数字
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:58.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I then followed up with the numbers that really matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:01:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那天我看过的拖拉机 那些中型拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:01:01.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All those tractors I looked at the other day, those medium-sized tractors...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:06.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 价格都要十二万 十八万
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:06.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah? They were all around a 120, 180, kind of on the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.24,0:01:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.24,0:01:07.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这台只要八万五
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}85.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:12.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}八万五 八万五千英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.60,0:01:12.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}85? 85,000. I was--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}2016年的 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:14.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}A sixteen plate? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}八万五 八万五
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}85,000? 85,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}约克郡的人会讲价 太划算了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yorkshire haggling! That's a bargain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好大一台 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.12,0:01:23.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's fucking huge! It is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:24.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}坐在驾驶舱里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:24.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Like- When you're up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以看清国际空间站里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you can eyeball people in the International Space Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.04,0:01:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们经过时会跟你打招呼 "你好 杰里米" "最近怎样"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.04,0:01:30.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They're coming past you going: "All right, Jeremy?" "Yeah. How's things?"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他喜欢我的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:34.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}He likes my tractor!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}带GPS吗 带的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.68,0:01:37.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You have GPS on this? Yeah, you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:40.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}带GPS 我去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.08,0:01:40.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it has GPS. Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}光是那个GPS就值一万
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.52,0:01:42.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That GPS there is worth ten grand on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}走起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.88,0:01:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还有前悬架 坐着肯定很舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.88,0:01:51.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got front suspension on that, look. This is gonna be comfy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:53.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}前悬架可以调整
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.28,0:01:53.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So you can alter your front suspension.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以前那台也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you could in the old one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:56.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是一直用不了 坐着不舒服 用不了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.16,0:01:56.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But it didn't ever really work, did it? Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:01:58.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}一直都是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:01:58.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, never. Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:02.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我爱死这台拖拉机了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:02.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I fucking love this tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很不错 是吧 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.56,0:02:04.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's nice, isn't it? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不仅如此 我还希望 它能凭借其超强的动力
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.60,0:02:08.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}More than that, I was hoping that with its extra power,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:11.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}解决我们的燃眉之急
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:11.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it'd be the answer to our prayers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}让我们赶在查理指定的最后期限前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:15.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and we'd be able to get the durum wheat field ploughed and planted
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}完成硬粒小麦田的翻犁和播种
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:18.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}before Charlie's deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}再倒一点 你得往那边开
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:28.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come back a little bit more. You've gotta get over that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:30.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然而第二天 当我们用它干活时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.32,0:02:30.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The next day, however, when we put it to work...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}哇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:31.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}驾驶舱的布局让我们遇到了麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:36.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}...we did encounter a problem with the layout of the cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:42.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}每个控制按钮都跟以前那台不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:42.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Every single control in here is different to my old tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:47.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.68,0:02:47.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa, whoa, whoa. For fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你得让它浮起来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.84,0:02:49.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You have to float it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}额
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:52.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.68,0:02:54.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.16,0:02:56.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:02:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道它们有什么功能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.00,0:02:59.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:01.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}额
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.96,0:03:01.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Urgh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.80,0:03:03.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.48,0:03:05.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你太没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:07.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You're literally useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}让它浮起来以后 它会将压力从那根管子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.80,0:03:10.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}When you float it, it releases the pressure out of that pipe...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}释放到油箱 懂了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:12.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah. Into your tank. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:16.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯 我还是不知道是哪个按钮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.92,0:03:16.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. I still don't know which button it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.32,0:03:19.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.52,0:03:22.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, shitting hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:26.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它掉下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:26.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's it just fallen off?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在犁完全倒向了一侧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.80,0:03:33.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The plough has now fallen over completely to one side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不知道有没有弯曲或断裂 没人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.16,0:03:36.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know if it's bent something or broke something. Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为了救急 我把叉车开了过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:44.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Eager to rescue the situation, I went off to get the telehandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}别把犁弄坏了 不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.72,0:03:46.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't damage the furrows. No, I'm not going to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}伸缩臂往回收 靠近机器
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:50.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Pull your boom in. Pull your boom in. Go closer to the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 停下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.96,0:03:56.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. No, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这样抬不起来 犁太沉了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.92,0:04:01.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It won't lift it like that. It's too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}叉车在报警
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.92,0:04:03.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's beeping at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我按到什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:06.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What have I pushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:09.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 你让叉车进入安全模式了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:09.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, what you've done is the machine is now in the Safety Mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它在提醒你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.76,0:04:10.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're saying to you:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"现在我不接受你的控制
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Look, we're locking you out of everything
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:13.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}因为后轮悬空了"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:13.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}because your back wheels are off the floor."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 基本上 你做的就是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:15.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So what you've basically done this morning:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}起床之后帮我干农活
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.16,0:04:17.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you've woke up, you've come and helped me on the farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你搞砸了一台机器 让它变成了这个姿势
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.32,0:04:19.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you fucked one machine and got it into that position,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你又让叉车的轮胎悬空 在院子里动弹不了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.68,0:04:22.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and then you've got the telehandler now stuck in the yard again
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在它启动了安全功能 拒绝任何控制
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.40,0:04:25.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}in the air so therefore it's going: "Safety feature: no."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}最终 卡莱布运用农场物理学
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:32.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Eventually, using farmyard physics,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把这个问题解决了一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:35.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb partially solved the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}现在它掉不下去了 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:39.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, now it can't fall. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后通过对兰博基尼的控制
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.68,0:04:43.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, after taking charge of the Lambo's controls...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}犁立起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:47.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The plough is upright.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:51.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们基本上耽误了两个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.28,0:04:51.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We're basically where we should have been two hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们前往地里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.64,0:04:57.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We then headed off to the field where we needed to plant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:05:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要尽快将硬粒小麦种上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.80,0:05:01.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}our durum pasta wheat as quickly as possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}从上次中断的地方接着干
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:06.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Pick up where we left off last time, which was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:07.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:09.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:09.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And crossed our fingers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}新的兰博基尼动力够强
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:13.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}in the hope that my new Lambo would have enough oomph
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}能够犁开浸湿的土壤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.36,0:05:15.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to plough the wet soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}给点油门
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:17.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Give it some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:27.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}老天 动力够强的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.56,0:05:27.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus, it's got some power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 老天
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.84,0:05:29.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yeah. Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那台老兰博基尼拖着很吃力
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:33.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, the old Lambo was really struggling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这台游刃有余
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:36.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is like cruising.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}太给力了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.52,0:05:38.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Holy moly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}简直难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.64,0:05:41.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:48.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}后面的犁重达五吨 但我几乎感觉不到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:48.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a five-tonne plough on the back. I can barely feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}拖着它爬坡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:50.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Pulling it uphill!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:55.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在被雨水浸泡了六个月的地里爬坡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:55.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Uphill, on a field that has been rained on solidly for six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后卡莱布跟在后面 用动力耙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:02.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb then followed behind, using a power harrow
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}让犁过的地做好播种的准备
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.92,0:06:06.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to make the ploughed field ready for planting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}犁完这块地需要一个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.12,0:06:13.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll have this field ploughed in an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后用我的新式标记系统 完成硬粒小麦的播种
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:17.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then we put the durum wheat in it using my new marker system.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:20.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗖的一下 搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.68,0:06:20.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Bish, bash, bosh, pasta on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:26.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道在犁地比赛中 有一项评分标准是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.08,0:06:26.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I know one of the things you're marked for in ploughing competitions
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}犁出的线条是否平直
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.12,0:06:30.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}is the straightness of your lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:35.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我大概能得个一分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:35.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd probably get a one for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}甚至零分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.56,0:06:39.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Maybe a nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:46.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}也许我的犁地技术马马虎虎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:46.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}My ploughing may not have been very good,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过当地的野生动物似乎并不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.40,0:06:50.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but the local wildlife didn't seem to mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看那边 好多红鸢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.44,0:06:53.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at the red kites there. There's loads of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:12.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好大一群红鸢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.08,0:07:12.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, there's an absolute squadron of red kites now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.36,0:07:14.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at this. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.88,0:07:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我从没见过这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.88,0:07:21.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've never seen so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:36.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}真是太好了 又可以在蓝天下耕作了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:36.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's so nice to be farmering again in blue skies!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}大约一个小时后 我们准备好开始第二阶段了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.80,0:07:45.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}An hour or so later, we were indeed ready to start phase two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:49.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That to me looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来可以播种了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:53.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That looks like the sort of thing you'd plant seeds into.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:59.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们将使用老兰博基尼来播种
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.76,0:07:59.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To do the planting, we would use the old Lambo,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:04.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我已经为它装上了 新的改进型涂料标记系统
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.20,0:08:04.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}which I'd fitted with my new-and-improved paint-marker system.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:08.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是白色涂料罐 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:08.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Here's your tank of white paint, okay? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那是电池
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.24,0:08:09.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And there's your battery.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:12.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这里有两个泵 左右各一个 好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.96,0:08:12.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And you've got two pumps, left and right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.44,0:08:13.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Got you, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:19.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个泵将涂料泵进塑料管 一路流到标记器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.60,0:08:19.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This pumps paint down that tube all the way to the end of the marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:21.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等着瞧吧 我要在《农民周刊》上打广告
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.48,0:08:21.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Wait till I advertise this in Farmer's Weekly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就连休格爵士 管他叫什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:23.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Even Mr Sugar, whatever he is,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:25.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}休格勋爵 他见了以后都会说
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:25.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Lord Sugar, he'll be looking at this going:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:28.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"阿姆斯特拉德的东西 纯属浪费时间 我应该用这个的"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.76,0:08:28.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Why did I waste my time with Amstrad? I should have done this."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你应该知道 这种东西早就发明出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.00,0:08:30.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And you are aware this has already been invented?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你说是你发明的 还没有发明出来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:33.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause you're saying you invented it. It hasn't been invented.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}已经发明出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It has.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么意思 有一种泡沫标记器
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.20,0:08:36.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you mean "it's been invented"? There's a foam marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它不是使用涂料 而是使用泡沫 留下一条泡沫标记
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.28,0:08:39.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Instead of paint it does foam. So it leaves a mark of foam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}已经有一家公司发明出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.24,0:08:41.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's a company that's invented it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那我又发明了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.68,0:08:43.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it's been invented again now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没想到 这个一贯愤世嫉俗的家伙 很快就认错了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:51.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}As it happened, the resident cynic was soon eating his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他的发明竟然挺好用
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:54.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}His invention's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:58.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不是只能画一米五 而是可以一直画下去 看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.52,0:09:03.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And not just for like five feet but forever. Look, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我太激动了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I am so thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就这样 我们完成了硬粒小麦的播种
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.24,0:09:14.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So, we got the durum wheat planted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后又有更多的好消息传来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:17.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, there was more good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我终于找到了一家酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.76,0:09:24.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Because I'd finally found a pub.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就在A40高速公路的边上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:27.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's literally on the A40.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以在交通方面 不会造成任何问题
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.36,0:09:30.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So traffic-wise, we're not gonna be causing any problems at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:31.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okey-dokey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过在提出要约之前
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Before putting in an offer, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.48,0:09:37.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得最好先得到丽莎的认可
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.48,0:09:37.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought I'd better get Lisa's approval.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这家酒吧比"马车与马"贵多了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.72,0:09:40.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's quite a lot more than the Coach & Horses was going to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:44.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我想你会认同它物有所值的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.64,0:09:44.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}but I think you'll agree there's a lot more to it.
