Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.32,0:13:36.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at this. How the fuck have they done this? This looks fresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.24,0:13:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们应该怎么办 破坏真的很严重
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.24,0:13:40.64,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What are we going to do about this? That's really devastated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 可以感觉到 树液 这棵树活不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:43.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look, you can... Oh, the sap. That's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}树液会流光的 这棵树死定了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.24,0:13:45.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All the sap is just going to come out. That tree is toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:47.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}杰拉德会很生气的 杰里米
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.84,0:13:47.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Gerald's going to be so upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:49.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 这些树是 杰拉德在六十年前亲手种的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.16,0:13:49.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, Gerald planted all these trees 60 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我看了看这下面
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:51.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I've just seen down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:56.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}全都毁了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.64,0:13:56.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Ruined, ruined, ruined, ruined, ruined. Scheisse.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们考虑不周 是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We didn't think about that, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 恐怕我们得反思一下 在树林里养猪的做法了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:02.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No. We have to rethink this woodland pig strategy, I fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.60,0:14:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这些是公猪 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.60,0:14:05.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, these are the boys. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 长出了好多小树苗 它正在啃食树苗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:08.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, all the little saplings coming up. He's just getting one now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:12.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的 公猪造成的破坏 还不及母猪的一半
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:12.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}To be honest, the boys aren't doing half as much damage as the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}就拿女厕来说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:13.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like girls' lavatories.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}受损程度总是比男厕更严重
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.92,0:14:16.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}They're always more vandalised than boys' lavatories.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你是怎么知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.40,0:14:17.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在我看来就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.92,0:14:19.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, in my mind they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:22.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}当你以这种口吻陈述一个事实时 它就是事实
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.36,0:14:22.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}If you state a fact like that, it is a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:25.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们来到了关猪崽的围场
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:25.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We then reached the piglet enclosure.
