Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:27.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Here they come. They've got so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:31.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们立刻就发现了一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.92,0:14:31.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And almost immediately, we spotted a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:32.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:32.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But hang on.
