Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}小家伙太可爱了 但是我不确定
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:43.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That is the cutest little thing. But I'm not sure- I mean, look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你看它 看 它在那里 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:45.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, there he is. I know.
