Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:48.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What shall we call it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}理查德
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.00,0:14:49.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Richard.
