Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"别这样 不然它们会以为我很小"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.88,0:15:21.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Don't do this. They're all going to think I'm little."
