Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:28.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look how feisty he's become.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.04,0:15:30.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 它 名字取对了
