Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.96,0:21:13.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I reckon you've got a flat tyre on that drill, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}瘪得像个煎饼 瘪了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:24.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's flat as a pancake. Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:25.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:25.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.44,0:21:29.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}该死 我想睡一觉 把今天划掉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.44,0:21:29.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Why don't I just go to bed and write today off and just say:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对自己说 "今天不曾发生过"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:30.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"Okay, today never happened."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}鉴于汽车修理厂不接这种活
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:35.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Given that this wasn't a job for Kwik Fit,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.28,0:21:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我只能回到院子里 试着自己动手拆下瘪掉的轮胎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.28,0:21:39.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I had to go back to the yard and try and get the wheel off myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.52,0:21:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}扳手伸不进去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.52,0:21:47.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you can't get a spanner in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.72,0:21:52.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How do you--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 那就 扳手柄放不进去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.48,0:21:56.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. So. Oh, you can't get a handle in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:21:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}轮毂太小了 扳手柄放不进去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:21:59.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The wheel's too little to get a handle in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.48,0:22:02.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.48,0:22:02.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.16,0:22:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 你这个小坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.16,0:22:05.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, you little bugger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.08,0:22:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 我的脖子 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.08,0:22:11.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, I can't do it. My neck. Ow, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.20,0:22:19.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等一下 有延长套筒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.20,0:22:19.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hang on. That's an extender thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:28.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:28.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}For fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我讨厌体力劳动 讨厌死了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.16,0:22:33.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I fucking hate manual labour. I properly do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.40,0:22:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}噢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.40,0:22:35.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}转动了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.08,0:22:36.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that turning?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:42.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}转动了 我去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:42.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's turning. Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.72,0:22:44.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我是怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.72,0:22:44.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How have I done that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.08,0:22:51.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All right? Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布帮我把轮胎滚到一个水桶边上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:54.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb then rolled the wheel over to a tub of water
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.88,0:22:57.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}以便确定扎孔的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.88,0:22:57.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}to find out where the puncture was.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.84,0:22:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好 把水桶装满
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.84,0:22:59.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I filled the bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.76,0:23:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.76,0:23:02.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my fucking God.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:04.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么了 刚才水桶装满了水
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.28,0:23:04.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What? We got the bucket filled up,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.00,0:23:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}轮胎滚过来时 把水桶撞裂了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.00,0:23:07.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I wheeled it over, it hit the bucket and split it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.84,0:23:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.84,0:23:09.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You're joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.72,0:23:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}今天是怎么了 今天不吉利
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.72,0:23:11.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What is going on today? It's today, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我简直不敢相信
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:14.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm in disbelief!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}真是的 今天做什么都不顺
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:19.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, honestly, it's everything today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.56,0:23:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}等我们找到漏气的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.56,0:23:24.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}By the time we'd found the leak,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.44,0:23:27.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}把轮胎补好 回到地里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.44,0:23:27.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}repaired the hole and got back to the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.68,0:23:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}下午已经过去了一大半
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.68,0:23:29.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it was well into the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 至少终于可以开始播种了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.72,0:23:34.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But, at least, we could finally start planting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.96,0:23:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我要出发了 走起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.96,0:23:36.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And I'm going. Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.08,0:23:45.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么鬼情况
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.08,0:23:45.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What the bloody hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.20,0:23:51.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}手刹没松
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.20,0:23:51.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is the handbrake on?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.36,0:23:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我按到什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.36,0:23:57.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What the bloody hell have I pushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.08,0:24:00.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我什么都没碰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.08,0:24:00.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I haven't touched anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.44,0:24:03.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}到底是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.44,0:24:03.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:05.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.12,0:24:05.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:07.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.52,0:24:07.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:09.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.36,0:24:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}听声音是大毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.36,0:24:11.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That sounds expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这下完了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:13.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is fucked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.36,0:24:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看看谁来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.36,0:24:14.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is- Oh, now look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他也没见过这台拖拉机吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:16.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, he hasn't seen this tractor either, has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.72,0:24:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}天哪 这下好了 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.72,0:24:17.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God, that'll be good. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:20.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他第一次见到这台拖拉机 正赶上拖拉机快爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.12,0:24:20.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The first time he sees it and it's gonna blow up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.72,0:24:22.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我会跟他说没什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.72,0:24:22.28,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll just tell him it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.24,0:24:24.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.24,0:24:24.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.60,0:24:25.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 查理
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.60,0:24:25.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, Charlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.16,0:24:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.16,0:24:27.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.76,0:24:30.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.76,0:24:30.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.24,0:24:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的新拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.24,0:24:31.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}My new tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.16,0:24:33.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 说是"新拖拉机"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.16,0:24:33.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I say "new tractor"--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.92,0:24:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么要买它 明明
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.92,0:24:36.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, but why have you got it? Ignore the fact that--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.48,0:24:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那台银色的老是出毛病
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.48,0:24:38.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}The silver one kept breaking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.40,0:24:42.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我买了这台新一点的 动力强多了 也更大
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.40,0:24:42.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So I bought this newer one, which is much more powerful and bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.88,0:24:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你猜怎么着 它坏掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.88,0:24:45.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And guess what? It's broken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.00,0:24:47.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我感觉是变速箱的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.00,0:24:47.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I think the gearbox is shagged on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.64,0:24:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可是
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.64,0:24:49.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.16,0:24:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 所以你就直接把它买回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.16,0:24:53.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, so you just went ahead and bought this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.28,0:24:54.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它用了多少个小时了 五百
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.28,0:24:54.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How many hours has it done? 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.68,0:24:56.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}三千 我是说三千
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.68,0:24:56.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}3,000. I meant 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.16,0:24:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我还没说价格呢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.16,0:24:59.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But you haven't heard how much it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.56,0:25:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}三百 猜猜看 这台340匹马力的花了多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.56,0:25:02.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Guess how much 340 horsepower cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.84,0:25:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}有340匹马力 GPS 都能用
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.84,0:25:05.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}So you got 340 horsepower, GPS, it's all working, etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.92,0:25:07.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你猜他花了多少钱买的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.92,0:25:07.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}How much do you reckon he paid for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.60,0:25:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想谈这个
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.60,0:25:10.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I almost don't want to enter the conversation
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.72,0:25:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我担心再谈下去 我会认为买得对
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.72,0:25:13.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}in fear that I might justify this decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.24,0:25:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}八万英镑 太贵了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.24,0:25:15.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}80,000. Far too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.40,0:25:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}什么 这个价格
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.40,0:25:17.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What? The fact is
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.00,0:25:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}完全可以买一台更好的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.00,0:25:20.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you could have got, you know, something appropriate for that price.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.64,0:25:22.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托 它看起来棒极了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.64,0:25:22.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on, it looks fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.00,0:25:26.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不 并不是 我们在努力提高农场的效率
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.00,0:25:26.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it doesn't. We're trying to run an efficient farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.28,0:25:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 但是请允许我 拥有一台我喜欢的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.28,0:25:29.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, no. Please allow me to have a tractor I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.88,0:25:30.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.88,0:25:30.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.64,0:25:33.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我也没得选 你已经买了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.64,0:25:33.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I don't have any choice. You've bought it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.64,0:25:36.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 现在的问题是 它的声音听起来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.64,0:25:36.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, the problem is, it sounds like
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.24,0:25:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}像是后轮轴装满了碎石
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.24,0:25:39.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}that- the rear axle's full of gravel
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.16,0:25:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}引擎是在鹅卵石上运转
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.16,0:25:43.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and the engine is running on pebbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.60,0:25:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}保修期是多久
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.60,0:25:45.00,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}What warranty did you get with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.16,0:25:47.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没有保修 二手货 2016年的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.16,0:25:47.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}There's no warranty. It's second-hand, mate. It's second-hand. It's a sixteen plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.84,0:25:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}二手拖拉机也应该有保修 你应该知道的 卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.84,0:25:50.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You can get warranty on second-hand tractors. You know that, Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.72,0:25:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我知道 问题是他没问过我
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.72,0:25:52.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I know. He didn't ask me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.96,0:25:54.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你害我挨骂
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.96,0:25:54.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You got me in trouble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.60,0:25:56.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你自己说这台拖拉机不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.60,0:25:56.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You said it was a good tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.52,0:25:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我是说价格划算
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.52,0:25:57.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, good for the value.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.16,0:26:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}跟以前那台200匹马力的相比 这台是340匹 要八万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.16,0:26:01.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}In terms of the one that you've got, you've got 270 horsepower. This is 340.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.36,0:26:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不需要340匹 我同意 我和你是一边的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.36,0:26:04.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}We don't need 340. I agree. I'm on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.16,0:26:07.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我和你是一边的 没错 这台拖拉机很烂
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.16,0:26:07.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm on your side. Yes, it's a shit tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不烂 如果把兰博基尼的标牌拿下来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.88,0:26:09.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's not shit. Despite the Lamborghini badge,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.12,0:26:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}简直就烂透了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.12,0:26:11.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}it's incredibly shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.52,0:26:14.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}它不烂 它只是坏了 不是烂
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.52,0:26:14.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And you've got to spend- It's just broken. It's not shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:28.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我的拖拉机暂时用不了 要等修理工来维修
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.16,0:26:28.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}My tractor would now be out of action until the mechanic came round.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}不过 我打算买的酒吧 倒是让查理大加夸赞
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:34.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But one thing that did impress Charlie was the pub I was planning to buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.32,0:26:36.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}真的很不错 对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.32,0:26:36.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's really cool, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.20,0:26:40.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}在"迪丽斯库阿特"团队看酒吧的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.20,0:26:40.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And during the Diddly Squat look-around,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.36,0:26:42.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布同样赞不绝口
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.36,0:26:42.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb was equally smitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.08,0:26:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我见过的最漂亮的酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.08,0:26:46.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is like the most beautiful pub I've ever been in.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.40,0:26:48.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你是去奇平的红狮酒吧次数太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.40,0:26:48.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You go in the Red Lion at Chippy too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:52.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}楼上还有吗 可以上去吗 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.68,0:26:52.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is there an upstairs? Can I go up? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.96,0:26:54.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.96,0:26:54.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}This is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:56.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这是老的马车车轮 是吧 那里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:56.72,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's an old wagon wheel, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.12,0:26:58.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}看 他在那里 这是老的马车车轮
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.12,0:26:58.60,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Look, there he is. That's an old wagon wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.76,0:27:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.76,0:27:00.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It is a wagon wheel. See!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.68,0:27:01.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我喜欢马车车轮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.68,0:27:01.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I love a wagon wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.64,0:27:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}再弄一些黄铜马饰 就齐活了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.64,0:27:04.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And we can get some horse brasses and we're away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.64,0:27:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以把我的飞镖板挂在这里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.64,0:27:06.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can I have my dart board over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.96,0:27:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还记得《长大》中的汤姆·汉克斯吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.96,0:27:08.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You remember Tom Hanks in Big?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.92,0:27:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你想把蹦床摆在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.92,0:27:10.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Where do you want your trampoline?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}那天晚上 在当地的一家酒吧里
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.52,0:27:13.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}That evening, in our own local,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.72,0:27:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我分享了 我买下那家酒吧后的打算
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.72,0:27:18.88,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I shared my thoughts about what I wanted to do with the pub once I took possession.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.00,0:27:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你们知道那家酒吧的二楼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.00,0:27:22.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know upstairs there, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.08,0:27:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我想在那里搞一个农民俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.08,0:27:25.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I want to put a farmers' clubhouse in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.40,0:27:26.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.40,0:27:26.20,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.36,0:27:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还记得我们来的时候 在路上遇到的那些农民吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.36,0:27:29.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause you know, we came here, and we met up with those farmers?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.12,0:27:32.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你跟我说 "他们通常会待在家里"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.12,0:27:32.76,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You said to me, ordinarily, they would have been at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.92,0:27:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 或者坐在办公室里 郁闷
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.92,0:27:34.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Or sat in the office. You know, moping.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.12,0:27:36.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}担心 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.12,0:27:36.16,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Worrying, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.60,0:27:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但是由于我们来到酒吧喝啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.60,0:27:39.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But because we all came to the pub and had a pint,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.24,0:27:42.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以拿自己的烦心事开玩笑 而不是担心那些事
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.24,0:27:42.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}you kind of laughed about your problems rather than worried about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.08,0:27:46.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这让我想到 如果我们在酒吧楼上的右手边
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.08,0:27:46.36,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And that got me thinking. If we put a farmers' clubhouse
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.76,0:27:50.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}搞一个农民俱乐部
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.76,0:27:50.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}in the right-hand side upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.16,0:27:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}摆放飞镖 酒吧桌球 设一个农民小吧台
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.16,0:27:56.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}and you put darts, bar billiards and a little farmers' bar up there...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.64,0:27:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以做飞镖队的队长吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.64,0:27:58.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can I please have my own... Can I be the leader of the dart team?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.12,0:28:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}可以 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.12,0:28:01.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You can be the leader of the darts team. Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.24,0:28:02.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以加入你的飞镖队吗 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.24,0:28:02.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Can I be in your darts team? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.56,0:28:07.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 我的想法是 我们为来的人提供免费啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.56,0:28:07.32,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway, and the idea is: go down there, we'll give you a free pint.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.76,0:28:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}他们可以坐下来 跟其他农民谈论烦心事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.76,0:28:10.80,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And you can sit and talk to other farmers about the problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.96,0:28:11.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个主意好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.96,0:28:11.96,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.88,0:28:14.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}这个主意好吗 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.88,0:28:14.68,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that a good idea? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.84,0:28:16.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}法律允许我们提供免费啤酒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.84,0:28:16.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you allowed to give away free pints?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.72,0:28:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我就知道你会说这样做有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.72,0:28:19.48,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I knew you'd say something wrong with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我查过了 没错 法律不允许提供免费啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.28,0:28:23.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}I looked into it. And no, you're not allowed to give away free pints.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.32,0:28:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}但我早就盼着在法庭上 被指控提供免费啤酒了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.32,0:28:25.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}But I'd long to go to court and be charged with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.52,0:28:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}关于谁是农民 存在灰色地带吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.52,0:28:28.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Is there a grey area around who's a farmer?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.60,0:28:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 前几天有人问我
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.60,0:28:30.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Somebody said that to me the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.68,0:28:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}"你要如何分辨 一个人是不是农民呢"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.68,0:28:32.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"How will you know that someone's a farmer?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.04,0:28:35.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}我们可以问那个人 "草甘膦是什么"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.04,0:28:35.56,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyone's a bit doubtful, you go, "Glyphosate is what?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.76,0:28:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}如果他不知道 他不知道 他不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.76,0:28:38.04,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And if they don't know! If they don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.76,0:28:42.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}谁要是说"不知道" "你不是农民 出去"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.76,0:28:42.40,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}"I don't know that." "You're not a farmer. Get out."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.60,0:28:47.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}要是遇到那种高筒雨靴上沾满了泥
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.60,0:28:47.44,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}When you say about farmers who just bring the mud on their Wellington--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.44,0:28:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}手里拿着花生的农民 明白我的意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.44,0:28:52.24,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}You know what I mean? You should do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.44,0:28:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你应该这样做 看起来不太聪明的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.44,0:28:54.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}It wouldn't look very smart within a week or two, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.28,0:28:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}年轻农民 如果我们一起走进一家酒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.28,0:28:56.12,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Young farmers, if we go into a pub together,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.28,0:28:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}酒吧会让我们脱掉靴子放在外面
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.28,0:28:58.08,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}they made us take our boots off outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.24,0:28:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}真的吗 是的 我们应该这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.24,0:28:59.52,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Really? Yeah. We should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.68,0:29:01.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}你不介意吗 不 我们能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.68,0:29:01.84,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}And you don't mind doing it? No. We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.04,0:29:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}还有 烤肉店也将回归
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.04,0:29:06.92,English,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, also, the carvery's coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.08,0:29:10.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,0,{\pos(960,1070)}很好 我喜欢烤肉店 很好 烤肉店
